    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game world has come to reality, all the rules have been subverted, and mankind has entered the era of national job transfer! Players will take on the role of a high school student who becomes a rare necromancer during the class transfer ceremony, embarks on one adventure after another, and gains self-growth and precious friendships. Through adventure and combat, the game makes people appreciate the preciousness and beauty of courage, camaraderie, and perseverance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main in-game features include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start Game - Click to enter to start game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archive  Read archive - You can click the archive button in the game to save the current chapter (you can choose multiple nodes to save), select any archive interface to enter the corresponding node</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter collation - You can select any chapter to enter the corresponding game chapter content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Path to God - Displays background images of all chapters the player has passed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settings - Adjust the screen of the game's resolution, volume, language adjustment, etc</p>",
